module

public import Mathlib.Data.ZMod.Defs

/-!
# The stretch census: the certificates' data
([RuleSpace] §4 Proposition 4.6)

The thirty-two quiescent tables, the sixteen nonzero seeds of diameter at most five read
from cell `0`, and for every pair of them the parameters `(T, P, lo, hi, dL, dR)` at which
the state at time `T + P` is the stretch of the state at time `T`, one list per table.
Data only; the module that decides it states what it certifies.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace ECA

